This print shows two toads patrolling a dandelion patch in the hunt for food.
Various bugs are in the area, hoping not to catch the toads' attention.

Toads are lucky. On a good day you can find everything in this scene in my back garden.

This is a variable edition print. The bugs are hand-stamped.

